{"id":"desprecio","lemma":"desprecio","pos":"noun","rank":4209,"glosses":["scorn, contempt"],"ipa":"/desˈpɾeθjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"desprecios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/17/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-desprecio.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él siempre habla con desprecio del gobierno.","en":"He always speaks of the government with contempt.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/929072","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"speech"},{"g":"with"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"government"}]},{"text":"Aún desprecio a esa gente.","en":"I still despise those people.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/605021","words":[{"g":"still, yet"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"people"}]},{"text":"Yo te desprecio.","en":"I despise you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440173","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Desprecio a esas personas.","en":"I despise those people.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/722107","words":[null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"that","l":"ese"},{"g":"person (an individual","l":"persona"}]},{"text":"Su comportamiento está más allá del desprecio.","en":"Her behavior is beneath contempt.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"behavior"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,null,{"g":"of the"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"farther"]]}]}